# Cloud sync (Phase 5) is entirely optional. Leave these unset and the app
# runs exactly as it did before Phase 5 — fully local, no account, no
# network calls to Supabase at all.
#
# To enable cloud sync:
#   1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
#   2. Run supabase/schema.sql (SQL editor or CLI) against that project
#   3. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the two values below
#      (Project Settings -> API in the Supabase dashboard)
#   4. Enable the auth providers you want under Authentication -> Providers
#      (Email is on by default; Google/Apple need their own OAuth setup —
#      see the comments in src/features/sync/authRepo.ts)

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
